{"id":"vod_sn_38866","vodId":"38866","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"月歌","name_cn":"月歌","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/105d933377c25fe28c76f61fba9074b9.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在月野艺能事务所之中，在事务所旗下，有两只非常活跃的偶像团体——Gravi和Procella，隶属于团体内的团员们，他们不仅仅是居住在同一幢公寓里的室友，同事也是活跃在同一个舞台上的竞争对手。　　Gravi里有元气可爱的师走驱（梶裕贵 配音）、拥有着强烈领导气质的睦月始（鸟海浩辅 配音）、和蔼可亲人见人爱的如月恋（增田俊树 配音）、温柔成熟稳重体贴的弥生春（前野智昭 配音）。Procella里有外冷内热沉默寡言的水无月泪（苍井翔太 配音）、深受朋友们信赖的文月海（羽多野涉 配音）、充满了魅力的中央空调叶月阳（柿原彻也 配音）。在不断的竞争和对抗中，他们之间亦生出了无坚不摧的友谊。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bfvdvVhUTc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nixUWbQnat1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/55L7sVGHf71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p1bpk5Y56i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X26cD6dWkx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1M6Gw81AwS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F1LGwNdseU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fXr1NzPCZf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/70E0UT4Lpm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/85vEdb1kYb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Wn0ZcD6hHE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZJRXdXTkth1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jQTX0j0men1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:53.534Z"}